    "body": "Not a docker expert, so I had to search the internet a bit, to get it running in the first place.\n\nI installed moby-engine, started the docker service and ran the integration test as sudo.\n\nBtw, I tried the same thing with silverblue in a virtual machine and I got the same result. I also tried to replace docker in the script with podman and got the same result again. \n\nWhere could I've got it wrong? I have to start the script while I am at the root of the project, right?   ",
