    "body": "Yeah, that all seems right.\r\n\r\nI'm actually using the official docker rpm for fedora 28 on a fedora 30 system (it was the only way I could find to get the right docker ce version), so this is all good information to have.\r\n\r\nCould you do a sanity check for me? Run `tree` (or the tree versions of `exa`, `lsd`, or your favorite tool) over the `starship` directory and post the output here?\r\n\r\n> I have to start the script while I am at the root of the project, right?\r\n\r\nThat's correct.",
