    "updated_at": "2019-09-07T21:12:29Z",
    "body": "[This](https://stackoverflow.com/a/31334443) solved the problem.\r\nApparently it was a SElinux problem.\r\n\r\nIn the end\r\n`docker run --rm -v $(pwd):/src/starship starshipcommand/starship-test`\r\nhad to be changed to\r\n`docker run --rm -v $(pwd):/src/starship:Z starshipcommand/starship-test`\r\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
