    "body": "I considered putting a note in the integration script, but I couldn't find a way to keep it short enough, so I'm going to use this issue as the canonical solution instead.\r\n\r\nI expect to find this issue for non-dnf/yum installs of docker on any RedHat-derivative systems, including RHEL,  Fedora (and any spins), and CentOS. More details on @Hofer-Julian's solution can be found at https://docs.docker.com/storage/bind-mounts/#configure-the-selinux-label.",
