    "created_at": "2019-09-08T14:47:28Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-09-08T14:47:28Z",
    "body": "In fact, @Hofer-Julian go ahead and throw up a PR using `security-opt` if you'd like. If someone else sees a technical issue, we can deal with it on the PR, but I don't think my \"mild philosophical objection\" is really worth much.",
